  "title": "ARNG perform evacuation operations in Pecan Grove, Texas after Hurricane Harvey",
  "description": "The 36th Sustainment Brigade, Army National Guard, assist the Texas Task Forces Two, urban search and rescue team conduct evacuations for flooded areas affected by Hurricane Harvey in Pecan Grove, Texas Sep. 1, 2017. The Rivers Edge neighborhood area in Pecan Grove is under a mandatory evacuation which is why Texas Task Forces Two and the 36th Sustainment Brigade were assisting residents that were unable to leave the area on their own. (Air National Guard video by Staff Sgt. Agustin G. Salazar)",
